                                                "sense_id": "2ef10ee1-89aa-3066-af3a-07cff49610f4",
                                                "text": "Never a Yankee was born or bred / Without that peculiar kink in his head / By which he could turn the smallest amount / Of whatever he had to the best account."
                                            },
