                                                "sense_id": "707603a4-521b-35d3-9684-1998f3977580",
                                                "text": "To top it all off, Lynn is into kink. Last night she was really into kink. It's a good thing that today is my day off because I need the time to recuperate and think things over."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
